00:17.500 --> 00:24.180
They are essentially trying to fit a round, infinitely complex universe onto a flat piece of paper.

00:24.380 --> 00:27.460
Right, which sounds like a joke about medieval map makers.

00:27.680 --> 00:28.120
Exactly.

00:28.120 --> 00:31.380
But it is actually the defining scientific crisis of our time.

00:31.620 --> 00:34.140
