20:11.360 --> 20:11.700
TARTAN.

20:12.360 --> 20:15.900
Trajectory-aware recursive tiling with annotated noise.

20:16.340 --> 20:20.920
Let's break that down because every word in that acronym is carrying a ton of mathematical weight.

20:21.060 --> 20:22.180
Let's start with the middle part.

20:22.340 --> 20:24.940
What does recursive tiling mean in this context?

20:24.940 --> 20:25.960
Yeah. What does that mean?

20:26.320 --> 20:29.600
Imagine you are trying to analyze a massive, complex space.

20:29.920 --> 20:32.140
You can't process the whole universe at once.

20:32.300 --> 20:33.300
