22:32.840 --> 22:34.700
Structural pressure in visual form.

22:34.740 --> 22:40.960
Exactly. Is that what failing a sheaf condition means? Is that an example of non-trivial cohomology?

22:41.080 --> 22:43.660
The Escher analogy is structurally perfect. Yes.

22:43.780 --> 22:43.940
Yeah.

